  "observations": [
    "At 101.50-102.40 the empty weapon rolls to expose its receiver; the left hand moves toward it.",
    "At 102.70-104.00 the long top cover is upright and the receiver/belt is exposed. The left hand brings a large feed box underneath/alongside the receiver; the hand occludes the exact latch and insertion boundary.",
    "At 104.30-104.85 the left hand crosses the open receiver and works the cover down. At 105.20 the HUD reads 68 and the weapon is lowered.",
    "At 105.70 a final hand/charging gesture occurs; the gun returns to ready by 106.40. An independently animated charging handle is not implemented."
